            "objective": "Use your Elemental Sight to follow Albedo's tracks",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1104104",
            "objective": "Reach the place where Albedo is",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "110410401",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Is that Albedo? Why would he hang around a place like this?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "110410402",
                    "speaker": "Rosaria",
                    "text": "The word on the street is he loves painting. He'll hang around anywhere for a good landscape."
                },
                {
                    "id": "110410403",
                    "speaker": "Rosaria",
                    "text": "The views and scenery here are pretty good, potential paintings everywhere you look."
                },
                {
                    "id": "110410404",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "But... can't he see those hilichurls? Isn't he in danger?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "110410405",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Eek!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "1104105",
            "objective": "Defeat the startled hilichurls",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1104106",
            "objective": "Speak with Albedo",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "110410601",
                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                    "text": "Who are you? Why did you alarm them?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "110410602",
                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                    "text": "Thank the gods I'd already completed my painting. Would've been a shame to leave these particular hilichurls unfinished.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "110410603",
                            "text": "You were painting hilichurls?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "110410605",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "What's up with painting hilichurls? What makes them so interesting?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "110410606",
                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                    "text": "Hmm, I'm afraid the answer isn't easy to explain. If you'd like to have a look at my painting, it may give you a clue.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "110410607",
                                            "text": "Uh...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410609",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Wow, look at the detail! But some of it seems to have been done in a hurry."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410610",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "You can find these hilichurls anywhere, quite boring in fact, not worth closer inspection."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410611",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "But take a look at this specimen. The build, the coat... And there's a distinct force at work here."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410612",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "In the cyclical lives of such primitive communities, such unique attributes are an indication of evolution at work. Evolution, the transition from nothing into existence, from the known to the un—"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410613",
                                                    "speaker": "Rosaria",
                                                    "text": "Hold your horses. Ugh, something tells me we're in for a thesis, and I haven't got the stamina."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410614",
                                                    "speaker": "Rosaria",
                                                    "text": "We've found your man, I'm headed back."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410615",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "What!? Don't you have any questions for him? Hey!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410616",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Ugh, what a weirdo."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410617",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "So Sister Rosaria brought you? Surprising. And I didn't have time to thank her."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410618",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "But back to the point. From her words, it seems that you were looking for me?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410619",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Mm-hmm, we met a girl in Mondstadt, Sucrose! She said you were stuck with your research."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410620",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "I see, so Sucrose sent you here."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410621",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "Then, if I'm not mistaken, you must be the Honorary Knight. You've got the whole of Mondstadt talking."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410622",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "I've heard a bit of everything: your actions during Stormterror's attack, your elemental control, and quite a few other mysterious things..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "110410623",
                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                    "text": "I'll skip to the conclusion, there's only one possibility after all. You came from afar — from another world. Correct?",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "110410624",
                                                            "text": "Correct.",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "110410626",
                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                    "text": "Excellent. If I could procure your assistance, I think my research would benefit enormously.",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "110410627",
                                                                            "text": "Your research?",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "110410629",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                    "text": "Ah — forgive me, this must be confusing. Where should I begin? Hmm... The essence of life?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "110410630",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "Whoa whoa, you want to start with that!?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "110410631",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                    "text": "Hmm... You're right. Giving a demonstration would be better than trying to explain."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "110410632",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                    "text": "For example, awakening life. Breathing new life into fallen leaves."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "110410634",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "You can do that!?",
                                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "110410635",
                                                                                            "text": "Alchemy really is miraculous.",
                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "110410637",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                                    "text": "However, I have a particular seed in my possession. The method I'm talking about has produced no results."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "110410639",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                                    "text": "It's like you, in that it hails from another world. Helping it to grow — to bloom... That's the problem my research is up against. That's where I'd need your assistance."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "110410640",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                                    "text": "Well, if you're struggling to figure it out, Paimon's not sure we're gonna be much assistance."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "110410641",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                                    "text": "I beg to differ. I'm unable to comprehend the intricacies of life outside of the known world."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "110410642",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                                    "text": "But you're not from the known world. By observing and researching you, I may just be able to find a way to get the seed to sprout."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "110410643",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                                                    "text": "So I'm an... object of research?"
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "110410644",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                                    "text": "#Uh... Shall we just get outta here, {NICKNAME}? This sounds a little freaky.",
                                                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "110410645",
                                                                                                            "text": "Is there any danger?",
                                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "110410646",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                                                    "text": "It's possible. But I will do everything in my control to ensure your safety."
                                                                                                                },
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "110410649",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                                                    "text": "Time for a change of surroundings, we should be going. There's research to do!"
                                                                                                                },
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "110410650",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Rosaria",
                                                                                                                    "text": ""
                                                                                                                },
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "110410651",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Rosaria",
                                                                                                                    "text": "Albedo and that Traveler seem to have hit it off."
                                                                                                                },
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "110410652",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Rosaria",
                                                                                                                    "text": "Takes a weirdo to know one I guess. I wonder... Does this constitute a risk to Mondstadt?"
                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                            ]
                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "110410647",
                                                                                                            "text": "What's in it for me?",
                                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "110410648",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Albedo",
                                                                                                                    "text": "Mora, knowledge. And the answer to the question you are seeking. It happens to be an answer that I can provide. How does that sound?"
                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                            ]
                                                                                                        }
                                                                                                    ]
                                                                                                }
                                                                                            ]
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "110410636",
                                                                                            "text": "Alchemy really is useful."
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "110410628",
                                                                            "text": "I'm not sure I understand."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "110410625",
                                                            "text": "You are worthy of your scholarly reputation."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "110410608",
                                            "text": "Very... avant-garde."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "110410604",
                            "text": "I thought you were painting a landscape."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}